  m_Name: ArcadeGameBullrush
  m_EditorClassIdentifier:
  Mode: 121
  IsMultiplayer: 1
  DisplayName: Bullrush
  Description: 'Rhinos only - a joust in a heap of floating sticks. Ram a rival from behind while you
    are faster than them to gore them - each gore is one point and knocks their petals
    loose. A gore needs speed: fly straight to wind up the Ramp Spool, and every Charge
    level lowers the speed a gore needs. The plough throws the sticks aside without slowing
    you, so the heap is cover, and the clearings are where you build the run. Crystals float
    in the clearings. Higher intensities grow the heap and add red-tipped sticks that sting.
    First team to the target wins.'
